flowchart TD

    Board[STM32F103C8 Blue Pill] --> Sensor[SensorTask: DHT22 + LDR]

    Board --> Input[InputTask: rotary encoder]

    Board --> Motion[MotionTask: PIR]

    Sensor --> DisplayQueue[xDisplayQueue]

    Sensor --> AlarmQueue[xAlarmQueue]

    Input --> ModeQueue[xModeQueue]

    DisplayQueue --> Display[DisplayTask: SSD1306]

    ModeQueue --> Display

    AlarmQueue --> Alarm[AlarmTask: temperature limits]

    Alarm --> Buzzer[TIM1_CH1 buzzer]

    Motion --> Events[xSystemEvents]

    State[StateTask: ACTIVE / INACTIVE] <--> Events

    Display --> OLED[OLED PB6 / PB7]